  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Sierbahnn",
      "content": "This movie starts out feeling as though it wants to go in one direction and then pulls a lovely twist and actually makes you get invested in a completely different movie. It does this in a really good way and there is no discontinuity between the two feelings. It's very creepy and very well acted and the directing is spot on. Even the effects carry the horror of this story forward and it turns out being a lovely little horror movie. I highly recommend it.",
      "rating": 6,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-21T07:19:37Z"
